  {
   "id": "poole/LUK.20.39",
   "range": "LUK.20.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fc89b35c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "poole/LUK.20.39#p1-fc89b35c",
     "text": "Ver. 39,40 The scribes were the Jewish doctors of the Pharisees faction, and enemies to the Sadducees; they applaud our Saviour’s answer: thus as the Herodians before, (in the case of the tribute), so the Sadducees here, are put to silence. He will now put the scribes and Pharisees to silence."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "poole/LUK.20.40",
